ARIA Accessibility Changes Log - Billing Module
=================================================
Date: 2026-02-11

1. billing-filter.component.html
   ------------------------------
   - Added role="region" and aria-label="Billing filters" to the root container
   - Added alt="Billing" to the money icon image
   - Added aria-label="Filter by experiment number" to the Experiment # input
   - Added aria-label="Filter by invoice number" to the Invoice # input

2. nav-billing.component.html
   ---------------------------
   - Added role="main" and aria-label="Billing management" to the root container
   - Added aria-label="Billing navigation tabs" to the mat-tab-group
   - Added aria-label="Filter by order type" to the filter radio group
   - Added aria-label="Jump to pending items" to the Pending button
   - Added aria-label="Jump to completed items" to the Completed button
   - Added aria-label="Jump to approved items" to the Approved button
   - Added role="tree" and aria-label="Billing items tree" to the billing items tree-root
   - Added role="treeitem" and dynamic [attr.aria-label] to tree node templates
   - Added dynamic [attr.alt] to tree node icon images (previously empty alt="")
   - Added dynamic [attr.aria-label] to the Expand/Collapse Labs toggle button
   - Added aria-label="Hide requests with no billing items" to the hide checkbox
   - Added alt="Information" to the information icon in the Prices tab
   - Added aria-label="Create new billing item" and alt="Add" to the create billing item button/icon
   - Added aria-label="Price sheets and categories" to the pricing ag-grid
   - Added aria-label to the three pricing display checkboxes (Show prices, Show price criteria, Show inactive prices)
   - Added aria-label and alt text to New sheet, New category, New price, and Remove buttons/icons
   - Added aria-label="Billing items detail table" to the billing items ag-grid
   - Added aria-label="Reassign or split billing items" and alt="Reassign/Split" to the Reassign/Split button/icon
   - Added aria-label="Remove selected billing items" and alt="Remove" to the Remove button/icon

